<p>Create an account to register for the current conference and submit a talk.
<strong>If you already have an account from a previous Perl Community Conference (PCC),
simply <a href="[% make_uri('main') %]">log in</a> with your existing username and join the current conference.</strong></p>
<p>Your profile will appear in the conference’s
<a href="[% make_uri('search') %]">attendee directory</a>, helping participants
connect before, during, and after the event.</p>
<p><strong>Speakers with approved talks receive a free ticket to the whole conference.</strong></p>
